<title>USA: Plasma-Therm Inc sells systems.</title>
<headline>Plasma-Therm Inc sells systems.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plasma-Therm Inc said Thursday it has sold four of its plasma processing systems to research and development firms in Georgia and New Mexico.</p>
<p>Neither the buyers nor the terms of the sales were disclosed.</p>
<p>Plasma-Therm produces plasma process equipment.</p>
</text>
